<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>University of Dagupan - Course Module</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .page {
            background: white;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin: 5px;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 5px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        p, li {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .activity {
            background: #f7f7f7;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #333;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #777;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        th {
            background: #eaeaea;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            padding-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="page">

        <div class="header">
            <h1>UNIVERSITY OF DAGUPAN</h1>
            <p>Course Module</p>
        </div>

        <h2>Course Information</h2>

        <p>
            This module contains the activities and lessons that students
            need to complete. The goal is to help students understand the
            topic and apply what they have learned.
        </p>

        <h2>Learning Objectives</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Understand the main ideas discussed in the lesson.</li>
            <li>Develop critical thinking skills.</li>
            <li>Participate actively in the activities.</li>
            <li>Apply the lesson to real-life situations.</li>
            <li>Complete the required tasks and assessments.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="activity">
            <h3>Activity 1</h3>

            <p>
                Read the lesson carefully and answer the questions based
                on your own understanding.
            </p>

            <ol>
                <li>What did you learn from the lesson?</li>
                <li>Why is the topic important?</li>
                <li>How can you apply it in your daily life?</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="activity">
            <h3>Activity 2</h3>

            <p>
                Write your own thoughts about the topic. Keep your answer
                simple, honest, and based on your personal understanding.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>My Answer:</strong><br>
                I learned that the topic is important because it helps
                students understand things better. I can also use what I
                learned in my everyday life.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="activity">
            <h3>Activity 3</h3>

            <p>
                Check the information first before accepting or sharing it.
                Make sure that the information comes from a reliable source.
            </p>

            <ol>
                <li>Check the source.</li>
                <li>Check if the information is true.</li>
                <li>Think before sharing it with others.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <h2>Assessment</h2>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Activity</th>
                <th>Description</th>
                <th>Score</th>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Activity 1</td>
                <td>Understanding the lesson</td>
                <td>10</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Activity 2</td>
                <td>Personal reflection</td>
                <td>10</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Activity 3</td>
                <td>Checking and analyzing information</td>
                <td>10</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <h2>My Reflection</h2>

        <p>
            For me, this module is helpful because it gives me a better
            understanding of the lesson. I learned new things and realized
            that I can use them not only in school but also in real life.
            I will try my best to complete the activities and improve my
            understanding of the subject.
        </p>

        <div class="footer">
            University of Dagupan | Course Module
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
